WEBVTT

00:01:59.204 --> 00:02:01.913
I do get to travel a lot for work --

00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:03.996
I’m very lucky to travel a lot for work.

00:02:03.996 --> 00:02:05.913
I was on a cruise ship not too long ago.

00:02:05.913 --> 00:02:08.413
I don’t know if any of you
have been on cruise ships.

00:02:08.413 --> 00:02:09.413
They’re very fun,

00:02:09.413 --> 00:02:11.246
especially if you love food like I do.

00:02:11.246 --> 00:02:12.454
I love food so much.

00:02:12.788 --> 00:02:14.329
I'm thinking about it right now.

00:02:14.329 --> 00:02:15.329
(Laughter)

00:02:15.871 --> 00:02:16.996
Cruise ships are great,

00:02:16.996 --> 00:02:18.163
there’s food everywhere.

00:02:18.163 --> 00:02:19.163
Everywhere.

00:02:19.163 --> 00:02:21.496
Wherever you turned
there was a tray of something,

00:02:21.496 --> 00:02:23.496
and you’re like,
“I guess I’m still hungry.

00:02:23.496 --> 00:02:24.496
I thought I wasn’t --

00:02:24.496 --> 00:02:27.496
I just had a seven-course meal
but I’ll have one of these, too.”

00:02:27.579 --> 00:02:28.579
Best thing:

00:02:28.579 --> 00:02:31.829
last cruise ship I was on
had a 24-hour pizza station.